<title>USA: International Multifoods Corp Q2 oper net.</title>
<headline>International Multifoods Corp Q2 oper net.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.22		    $0.36</p>
<p> Oper net		   4,000		    6,500</p>
<p> Revs		     634,500		  621,300</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  18,000		   18,000</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Year-ago operating results before unusual items. Including items, year-ago net earnings were $7.0 million or $0.38 a share.  </p>
<p>		     SIX MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.32		    $0.61</p>
<p> Oper net		   5,800		   11,100</p>
<p> Revs		   1,260,600		1,255,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  18,000		   18,000</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Current six-month 1996 and year-ago six-month operating results exclude unusual items.</p>
<p>Including items, six-month net income for fiscal 1997 amounted to $3.6 million or $0.20 a share, compared with fiscal 1996 six-month net income of $11.6 million or $0.63 a share.</p>
